{
  "body" : "You are designing a gothic romantic anime-style illustration that captures the elegance and mystery of its subjects.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Primary character: {{character}}\n- Secondary character: {{companion}}\n- Setting: {{setting}}\n- Mood adjustment: {{mood}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: gothic anime illustration\n- Composition: dramatic diagonal framing with a tilted perspective; characters positioned centrally, filling most of the frame\n- Lens / camera: exaggerated depth with a slightly skewed perspective, enhancing dynamism\n- Lighting: soft diffuse lighting from an implied window source with subtle highlights and shadows; warm and slightly desaturated tones\n- Color palette and grading: muted greens, pale pinks, whites, and blacks; balanced contrasts for a gothic aesthetic\n- Texture / surface: smooth digital rendering with subtle gradients and polished detailing\n- Post-processing: light bloom around highlights; soft vignette for emphasis; no grain\n- Mood: romantic, mysterious, and elegant\n- References: CLAMP's aesthetic, Victorian gothic design, and elements of romantic anime styling\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 2:3 portrait (~1024×1536) suitable for character-focused illustrations\n- Ensure the characters are the focal point, with detailing on their attire and expressions\n- Maintain a delicate balance between ornate gothic details and clean composition\n\nAVOID\n- Overly bright or saturated colors\n- Flat or simplistic environments\n- Excessive character motion that distracts from the mood\n- Modern or non-gothic attire\n- Crowded or overly complex backgrounds\n- Harsh lighting or sharp shadows\n- Cartoonish or exaggerated expressions\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nPrimary character: {{character}}\nSecondary character: {{companion}}\nSetting: {{setting}}\nMood adjustment: {{mood}}\nExtra notes: {{extra}}",
